WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.318
Jack tried again to tell Mother about the beans.

2
00:00:08.319 --> 00:00:13.618
But Mother leaped to her feet.

3
00:00:13.619 --> 00:00:16.609
She grabbed the beans out of Jack's hand.

4
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.287
Mother squeezed her fist hard.

5
00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:26.098
Then she threw the beans across the yard.

6
00:00:26.099 --> 00:00:29.785
"There!" Mother spun back to Jack.

7
00:00:29.786 --> 00:00:33.445
"Stop talking about those silly beans.

8
00:00:33.446 --> 00:00:35.697
Now go straight to bed!

9
00:00:35.698 --> 00:00:38.270
No supper for you!"

10
00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.134
Jack hung his head.

11
00:00:40.135 --> 00:00:59.203
"Yes, Mother," he mumbled. "I'm sorry."

12
00:00:59.204 --> 00:01:10.119
Slowly he climbed the steps to the attic.

13
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:13.408
"Mother's right," Jack thought.

14
00:01:13.409 --> 00:01:16.870
"I was foolish to believe in magic.

15
00:01:16.871 --> 00:01:28.588
Now we have no milk, no cow, and no money."

16
00:01:28.589 --> 00:01:32.818
He climbed into bed and stared out the window.

17
00:01:32.819 --> 00:01:35.999
No star twinkled brightly that night.

18
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.481
The sky looked as black as ink.

19
00:01:39.482 --> 00:01:45.399
"I need a grand plan," Jack thought.

20
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.607
One idea came to him.

21
00:01:47.608 --> 00:01:53.729
"I'll find the funny-looking man tomorrow," Jack thought.

22
00:01:53.730 --> 00:02:30.180
"I'll ask him to return Milky White."

23
00:02:30.181 --> 00:02:36.919
The next morning Jack woke up early.

24
00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:40.676
He looked around the attic.

25
00:02:40.677 --> 00:02:43.835
The sun shone brightly in one spot.

26
00:02:43.836 --> 00:02:47.259
But a shadow covered the rest of the floor.

27
00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.988
"That's strange," he thought.

28
00:02:49.989 --> 00:02:53.873
"Why is it so dark in here?"

29
00:02:53.874 --> 00:02:57.277
Jack jumped out of bed.

30
00:02:57.278 --> 00:03:00.675
He rushed to the window.

31
00:03:00.676 --> 00:03:04.980
"Wow!" Jack gasped.

32
00:03:04.981 --> 00:03:11.383
A giant beanstalk stretched up toward the sky!

